abstract: "A philosophical framework exploring the relationship between divination and science, providing methodologies for applying traditional wisdom in modern decision support. This repository serves as both a knowledge community and a startup cold-start platform for the Elephenotype project. 探索玄学与科学关系的哲学框架，为现代决策支持中应用传统智慧提供方法论。"
